<article class="content-prose long-form"><h2>Our approach</h2><p>Useful tools should be understandable from the first visit. Each online tool focuses on a specific task, explains what it does and gives users clear control over their files and results.</p><h2>Useful before complicated</h2><p>The first version focuses on image, PDF, text and audio workflows. Core tools are free and do not require an account. New tools will be added when they offer clear value and can be maintained properly.</p><h2>Privacy matters</h2><p>Where practical, file processing happens in the browser. Capabilities vary by format, browser and device. The privacy policy describes the current implementation and hosting caveats.</p><h2>Growing with feedback</h2><p>Nexauren Hub is evolving. Availability and interface details may improve over time; individual tool pages provide the current instructions and limitations.</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/tools/">Explore the tools →</a></article></div></main>
